Z||000002||Formula88||03-27-2001||06:52 PM||||Damn, dude. You're awful proud of that luggage arent you! <P>Pay no attention to the car on the right in this pic.  It's just LZeitgeist's  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif"><BR>However, the one on the left is mine!  At least this pic was taken when it still ran.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><BR>She's an 88 Formula (duh), 5-speed, sunroof, A/C, Power windows and locks, and a factory unopened wheel lock set in the trunk (the originals, I beileve)!  And to make the car perfectly mine, it has a GT steering wheel (my favorite) and leather shift knob (thanks LZ!).  Crappy tires right now, but that'll change when I get her running.  That and gotta get a regular Fiero 3-spoke steering wheel horn button so I can get rid of the GT emblem horn button.  Just got her in January.  It's gonna be a fun summer!  <IMG SRC="http://cwmonkey.virtualave.net/s/net7/biggthumpup.gif">  <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Me&Pat_Cars1.jpg"> <BR>The Twins will ride again!!  <IMG SRC="http://cwmonkey.virtualave.net/s/net7/beerchug.gif">  <BR>||||reg||1
